(audience applauds)

00:00:05.687 --> 00:00:07.798
That's a lot of work!

00:00:07.798 --> 00:00:09.078
You must love working with them!

00:00:09.078 --> 00:00:10.927
- I love working with them.
- [Kelly] It's a good team.

00:00:10.927 --> 00:00:12.287
- You know, I've been in the
business since I was seven

00:00:12.287 --> 00:00:13.678
so I've been doing this a long time

