and I've worked with a
lot of different people,

00:00:15.068 --> 00:00:16.488
a lot of great people,

00:00:16.488 --> 00:00:19.321
but they very much what the values

00:00:20.422 --> 00:00:22.172
that their movies emulate,

00:00:22.172 --> 00:00:25.000
they are like that as a
company and as people.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:25.833
- I love that.

00:00:25.833 --> 00:00:26.945
- And I'm so thankful
to work alongside them.

00:00:26.945 --> 00:00:28.096
They've become friends.

00:00:28.096 --> 00:00:29.686
- [Kelly] So Christmas in Rome, right?

00:00:29.686 --> 00:00:32.436
It's your eighth holiday
Hallmark film, right?

00:00:32.436 --> 00:00:33.270
- My eighth Countdown-
- [Kelly] Your eighth one!

00:00:33.270 --> 00:00:34.848
- To Christmas movie.

00:00:34.848 --> 00:00:35.681
- That's amazing!

00:00:35.681 --> 00:00:36.514
- Yeah, yeah!

00:00:36.514 --> 00:00:37.459
- Did you love it?

00:00:37.459 --> 00:00:38.292
Is this a good one?

00:00:38.292 --> 00:00:39.125
- [Lacey] I loved it!
- Okay.

00:00:39.125 --> 00:00:39.958
- [Lacey] It's such a fun one.

00:00:39.958 --> 00:00:42.345
We try to make each one
different and special

00:00:42.345 --> 00:00:44.954
and while the messages
are all very similar,

00:00:44.954 --> 00:00:49.305
this one was particularly fun
because I get to go to Rome

00:00:49.305 --> 00:00:51.955
and my character lives
there and she's a tour guide

00:00:51.955 --> 00:00:55.115
and it's her passion to show
people this beautiful city

00:00:55.115 --> 00:00:56.905
in a way that they've
never seen it before.

00:00:56.905 --> 00:00:59.783
So she encounters Sam Page plays Oliver.

00:00:59.783 --> 00:01:00.945
Wonderful actor.

00:01:00.945 --> 00:01:02.265
And he's there on a business trip

00:01:02.265 --> 00:01:04.013
and doesn't really plan
on seeing the city,

00:01:04.013 --> 00:01:06.505
so it's her missions to show
him what Rome is really about,

00:01:06.505 --> 00:01:07.702
what's at the heart of it.

00:01:07.702 --> 00:01:08.535
- [Kelly] Oh I love it!
- Yeah.

00:01:08.535 --> 00:01:09.506
- [Kelly] She's passionate about it.

00:01:09.506 --> 00:01:10.339
- [Lacey] And they're amazing.

00:01:10.339 --> 00:01:11.172
- Do you love Christmas?

00:01:11.172 --> 00:01:12.306
Is that why you're in eight films?

00:01:12.306 --> 00:01:13.669
- I love Christmas.
- I love Christmas.

00:01:13.669 --> 00:01:14.502
- We said it in sync!

00:01:14.502 --> 00:01:15.335
(audience applauds)

00:01:15.335 --> 00:01:16.168
(laughs)

00:01:16.168 --> 00:01:17.001
- [Kelly] But it was crazy.

00:01:17.001 --> 00:01:18.381
We were in unison.

00:01:18.381 --> 00:01:19.603
- [Lacey] I love Christmas.

00:01:19.603 --> 00:01:20.436
- Me too.
- I love it.

00:01:20.436 --> 00:01:22.311
I love decorating for Christmas early.

00:01:22.311 --> 00:01:23.144
- [Kelly] Me too.

00:01:23.144 --> 00:01:23.977
