75% of our presents already.

00:01:29.832 --> 00:01:30.861
- [Lacey] Have you really?

00:01:30.861 --> 00:01:31.901
- Not a joke.

00:01:31.901 --> 00:01:32.741
I don't play.

00:01:32.741 --> 00:01:33.574
(audience claps)

00:01:33.574 --> 00:01:34.407
I don't play.

00:01:34.407 --> 00:01:35.602
I don't have any time off.

00:01:35.602 --> 00:01:36.464
(laughs)

00:01:36.464 --> 00:01:38.413
So when I do I've got
Christmas music going

00:01:38.413 --> 00:01:40.296
wrapping in my dining
room like a crazy person!

00:01:40.296 --> 00:01:41.129
- [Lacey] I love it!

00:01:41.129 --> 00:01:42.248
And I love your Christmas music!

00:01:42.248 --> 00:01:43.306
- [Kelly] Oh thank you!
- Yes!

00:01:43.306 --> 00:01:44.139
- [Kelly] Oh thank you!
- I'm a real fan.

00:01:44.139 --> 00:01:45.547
- [Kelly] I love Christmas music!

00:01:45.547 --> 00:01:46.380
(audience claps)

00:01:46.380 --> 00:01:47.306
Oh my God, I'm with you.

00:01:47.306 --> 00:01:49.225
So what's Christmas like
at the McGraw house?

00:01:49.225 --> 00:01:50.696
- Well should we confess?

00:01:50.696 --> 00:01:51.867
- [Kelly] Yes!

00:01:51.867 --> 00:01:52.700
- We--
- Yes.

00:01:52.700 --> 00:01:55.577
- [Dr. Phil] When it comes
to that time of year--

00:01:55.577 --> 00:01:57.847
