00:02:21.171 --> 00:02:22.781
We've seen every one of your movies.

00:02:22.781 --> 00:02:23.614
(laughs)

00:02:23.614 --> 00:02:24.447
- [Kelly] Yes!

00:02:24.447 --> 00:02:26.328
- [Lacey] I'm so flattered!
Thank you!

00:02:26.328 --> 00:02:27.161
- [Lacey] That's so nice!
- We love them!

